        "media_caption": "",
        "content": "<h2>ESSENTIAL BEAUTY FORMULATIONS<br/>FROM CALIFORNIA.<br/>FOR THE SKIN AND SENSES.</h2><p></p><p>On the coast of Southern California, known for its perfect weather, ease of living and natural beauty, two friends with a common obsession for skincare and makeup (and over 20 years of collective experience in the industry) set off to reimagine what their daily routines could look and feel like.<br/><br/>Lauren as a busy mother, and Marianna with her jet-set schedule, identified a need for beauty that did more without overdoing it.<br/><br/>Their first product, Jet Lag Mask, embodied efficacy and simplicity.<br/>It was versatile.<br/>It was clean.<br/>It was multi-purpose.<br/>It sold out instantly.<br/><br/>Today the vision has grown into a carefully curated assortment of powerful-yet-gentle skincare products and hybrid makeup to make routines feel effortless and skin look luminous so every day feels like a Summer Friday.</p>",
